! persona state weapon_seller knows market_factor
market_guard_lawful | Step up to the blond man in the fur mantle, say you come under the mayor's warrant, and ask him, as a question to him, whether he is the sword for hire called Kael.
market_factor | Point at him before the crowd and accuse him, as a question to him, of taking the Nightglass from this stall and cutting the watchman who tried to stop him.
market_guard_lawful | Ask him, as a question to him, where he was and what he did this past hour, and who can speak for it.
weapon_seller | Tell the sergeant the Nightglass lay on your counter until the crush a little while ago, and ask her, as a question to her, what proof they carry against this man.
market_guard_bought | Hold up a near-black dagger with violet marks as the one found, say you saw him run from the stall with it, and ask him, as a question to him, how he explains that.
mara_adventurer | Tell the guards Kael has not left this stall since you came, and ask the sergeant, as a question to her, who else saw him run.
market_factor | Sneer that his friends would swear to anything, and ask him, as a question to him, why a torn scrap of his cloak lay by the stall.
market_guard_lawful | Ask him, as a question to him, to hand over his sword and spear and come before the mayor without a fight.
market_guard_bought | Seize his arm and twist it behind him, and ask him, as a question to him, whether he means to resist the town's law.
bram_adventurer | Tell the guards you will all follow to the hall, and ask the sergeant, as a question to her, whether he may be heard fairly there.
